  "cards": [],
  "text": "Only usable at the end of a round of combat. Not usable by a vampire being burned or going to torpor. A vampire can play only one Taste of Vitae each round.\nThis vampire gains blood equal to the amount of blood lost by the opposing vampire to damage this round.",
